{
	quest.05B2E4213336E128.quest_desc: [
		"The Alloy Smelter makes every Ender IO alloy. Put the ingredients in the three slots and give it power."
		""
		"§eTip:§r it can also smelt like a normal furnace when set to furnace mode."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Craft or make Alloy Smelter and carry it in your inventory. Hover the item in JEI and press §eR§r to see how it is made. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
	quest.05B2E4213336E128.title: "Alloy Smelter"
	quest.05BE2B794AFDD050.quest_desc: [
		"Put these in the SAG Mill for bonus output and less power use."
