	quest.16B18D168CC58302.quest_desc: [
		"Ender IO is known for its alloys, compact conduits and soul-based machines."
		""
		"§eThe path:§r the Alloy Smelter, then the SAG Mill and generators, capacitors and conduits. Later you'll capture mob souls and use them for spawners and the soul binder."
		""
		"Start with some soul sand; you'll need it for Soularium."
		""
		"§e§lHow to complete:§r Find, mine or loot 8 x Soul Sand and carry it in your inventory. The quest checks your inventory on its own; you can also click the task to hand items in."
	]
